# LF in the working tree on every platform, also on Windows with core.autocrlf (the default of Git for Windows and of
# actions/checkout there). Tests compare text files byte for byte (the API goldens, the README snippets) or read
# length-prefixed data (the bundle test vectors), and the shell scripts in tool/ do not run with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary test fixtures (SQLite files, protobuf payloads).
*.db binary
*.dat binary
